<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 15/16.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 15/16.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, May 16 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   16.05.97	  15.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5822	    6.5304</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3596	    2.3467</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.6030	    4.5746</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4429	    3.3619</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5271	    0.5211</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7810	    0.7790</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2949	    0.2933</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0089	    6.9729</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6941	    0.6948</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2713	    1.2687</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
